docs/eval/results/runs/*/traces.jsonl
docs/eval/results/runs/*/report.html
# 冻结原始标准保留原换行与哈希，随 archive.zip 保存，避免Git换行转换
docs/eval/results/runs/*/questions.jsonl
docs/eval/results/runs/*/evidence.json
docs/eval/results/runs/*/metrics-v1.md
